{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forks &amp; Daggers</strong> is a <strong>Chaotic</strong>\u00a0<strong>Medieval Social Deduction Game</strong> where players <strong>complete</strong> <strong>tasks</strong>\u00a0while hidden <strong>Assassins</strong> secretly\u00a0<strong>kill others</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>sabotage the manor</strong>. Find the traitor or choose to be a traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment as a weapon itself.</strong>\u00a0Grab and throw anything you find, equip a frying pan or a stick to defend yourself against a chaotic situation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/b927dfed65cfdf6033807fed79f4b62e.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're chosen to be an <strong>Assassin (Daggers)</strong>, you can <strong>sneak</strong> around, <strong>fake tasks</strong>,  and <strong>Eliminate servants</strong>,\u00a0all without getting caught. <strong>And need a partner in crime, invite anyone to your Dagger Club.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/d4bd05adce47990b77f52621b4b40725.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Out? No problem, manor is not done with you yet. Respawn as a <strong>Cat</strong> or <strong>Rat</strong> to mess around or help the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5d21216892956b39c102c4d4d266e4c3.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>Quests</strong> to win,\u00a0<strong>earn new skills</strong>, and <strong>improve yourself</strong> to be stronger and clever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/dda7f2bf1852fb6666144dbfcd8551d0.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>votes</strong> to decide who\u2019s suspicious. Hang the <strong>right person</strong> or let the real<strong> Assassin (Dagger)</strong> slip away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/78a9be00e4fffb75cc7f12d5fe79fd1f.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/78a9be00e4fffb75cc7f12d5fe79fd1f.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/78a9be00e4fffb75cc7f12d5fe79fd1f.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger traps to eliminate, use the environment as a support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.poster.avif?t=1759095041\" width=770 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.webm?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/extras/5b07fe27f90c0205ad1047b69888e30c.mp4?t=1759095041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve or Sabotage</strong> \u2013 Be a loyal servant or a secret assassin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong> \u2013 Clean, cook, gather, and repair the manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vote &amp; Execute</strong> \u2013 Ring the bell and vote to hang the suspected traitor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convert Others</strong> \u2013 Drop a red scroll to recruit new assassins mid-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Afterlife Roles</strong> \u2013 Play as a rat or cat after death to keep influencing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Traps</strong> - Learn and use the traps in the manor to eliminate in a creative way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyhing can be a Weapon\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Grab anything throw it to others or use as a weapon to defend yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3\u201310 Player Online Party Game</strong> \u2013 Fun, chaos, and betrayal with friends or strangers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513030?t=1759095041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/6af8b92ea75b0a4741516f3dc93d2c5cf0868ffa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759095041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/8fb9bbf34da0499a9a14aaf6ab25b9284322bef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759095041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513030/8fb9bbf34da0499a9a14aaf6ab25b9284322bef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759095041","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"descr